OL,4,BEmery praises Garnacho attitude after  
OL,5,BVilla selection snub                   
OL,6,GAston Villa boss Unai Emery has        
OL,7,Gpraised Alejandro Garnacho's           
OL,8,G"fantastic attitude" -but suggested    
OL,9,Gother players rank ahead of him after  
OL,10,Gthe Argentine was left out of          
OL,11,GTuesday's Champions League defeat at   
OL,12,GGalatasaray.                           
OL,14,FThe 22-year-old winger joined Aston    
OL,15,FVilla on loan from Chelsea in the      
OL,16,Fsummer, but he has played just 34      
OL,17,Fminutes in the Premier League this     
OL,18,Fseason.                                
